  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Jupiter.Runtime::Jupiter.World.Readable
  title: Crew medical, weekly summary
  body: 'OKAFOR: sleep 5.1 h average. Again. Talk to him.

    LINDQVIST: refused bone density scan (third time). Rescheduled. Again.

    FERREIRA: fine. Annoyingly fine.

    ASHFORD: blood pressure elevated. Says it''s the coffee.

    MORI: physician, heal thyself. (Fine.)


    (H.M.)'
