--- !u!114 &1330540418
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1330540416}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 00c313ed7574a19459cb30ce651f9d5b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Jupiter.Runtime::Jupiter.World.Readable
  title: Commander's log, Day 118
  body: 'Radar calibration completed two days ahead of schedule. Okafor is thorough. He doesn''t ask why we need this much resolution on the deep returns, which I''m grateful for.


    Lindqvist filed another objection to the power allocation. She wants the hours for lander testing. She isn''t wrong, and I told her so. The priority stands.


    Crew morale good. Ferreira has started a card league. Mori is winning.


    D. Ashford'
